      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 352,
        "height": 592,
        "content": "### 2. Algorithmic Scoring Engine\n**Description:** Flattens the raw Notion data and applies a custom mathematical formula to calculate a risk/effort priority score for each project."
